<<<
+ lain opened the anti-Home Rule campaign./The anti-high tariff Press in Germany.
===
+ *lain opened the* anti-Home Rule *campaign.*/*The* anti-high tariff *Press in Germany.*
>>>

<<<
In comparison with the pre-Boer war figures./The ex-Chief Whip's association with the constituency.
===
*In comparison with the* pre-Boer war *figures.*/*The* ex-Chief *Whip's association with the constituency.*
>>>

<<<
/ ACTION BY AN EX- LORD MAYOR./The ex-Navy League President.
===
/*ACTION BY AN EX-*LORD MAYOR./*The* ex-Navy League *President.*
